Subject: [PATCH] mshtml: table sections, captions and TxtRange.findText

THEAD, TBODY and TFOOT elements are table sections (IHTMLTableSection: align, vAlign, bgColor, rows,
insertRow, deleteRow; DispHTMLTableSection, HTMLTableSection, window prototype
HTMLTableSectionElement) and CAPTION is a table caption (IHTMLTableCaption, align, vAlign).
IHTMLTable tHead, tFoot, caption, createTHead, createTFoot, createCaption and the three deletes
now work on them. IHTMLTxtRange::findText searches forward or backward (negative count, flag 1)
within a range or from a point, for a number of characters, matching case (flag 4) and whole
words (flag 2) and leaves the range on the match, or unchanged when there is none.
The element type table and the document mode tag list of the tests record the new classes.

